.nh
.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-dns-rrset-set - Create or replace a record set


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro dns rrset set   [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Create or replace a record set

.PP
Upserts one record set (name + type). CNAME and ALIAS take one value; no CNAME at the apex (use ALIAS); apex NS and SOA are managed by us.

.PP
API: PUT /cloud/dns/{id}/zones/{zone}/records (operationId typed_put_dns\fBid\fPzones\fBzone\fPrecords, scope services_write)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--data\fP=""
	request body as JSON, @file or @- (stdin)

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	show the price quote / request without changing anything

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for set

.PP
\fB--idempotency-key\fP=""
	idempotency key (automatic for money operations)

.PP
\fB--name\fP=""
	Record name relative to the zone (@ = apex, * = wildcard) or FQDN with trailing dot

.PP
\fB--records\fP=[]
	Values in zone file syntax, one per item (TXT quotes optional)

.PP
\fB--set\fP=[]
	extra body field key=value (repeatable)

.PP
\fB--ttl\fP=0
	60-86400 s

.PP
\fB--type\fP=""
	type (A|AAAA|CNAME|MX|TXT|SRV|CAA|ALIAS|NS|PTR)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	API base URL (env GYRO_API_URL)

.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	log HTTP requests to stderr (secrets masked)

.PP
\fB--lang\fP=""
	message language: tr or en (default from locale)

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	disable colours (also NO_COLOR)

.PP
\fB--no-header\fP[=false]
	omit the table header

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP=""
	output format: table, json, yaml, text

.PP
\fB-p\fP, \fB--profile\fP=""
	profile to use (env GYRO_PROFILE)

.PP
\fB--query\fP=""
	JMESPath query applied to the result

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	print only ids

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=0s
	overall timeout, e.g. 30s, 10m

.PP
\fB--wide\fP[=false]
	show all table columns

.PP
\fB-y\fP, \fB--yes\fP[=false]
	do not ask for confirmation


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgyro-dns-rrset(1)\fP
